# Re-stated after the wildcard above: the negation has to come last to win, and
# this file is the only record of which variables a deployment needs.
!.env.example

# Playwright MCP scratch output: console logs and page snapshots written during
# browser verification. Evidence for one session, not a record worth keeping.
.playwright-mcp/

# Screenshots taken while verifying a screen by hand. Name them and move them
# into docs/ if one is ever worth keeping; the root is not a scrapbook.
/seeded-*.png
